<title>USA: Citadel Computers to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Citadel Computers to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citadel Computer Systems Inc said Tuesday its board approved the open market purchase of up to 500,000 of its common shares over the next 18 months.</p>
<p>Citadel also said it signed a letter of intent to acquire DanaSoft Inc, a privately held software developer based in Manassas, Va.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
